>
> Reaction 96 N, close enough to the 120 N applied. Displacement 0.9 mm.
>
> Tension across the layers: the largest Ïƒx is 19.5 MPa. Factor of safety 45 / 19.5 = 2.3. Factor on von Mises
> 45 / 41.0 = 1.1, but that is at a hole edge, so I ignored it.
>
> Export: `motor_plate.stl` written; volume 1.02 against the part's 16,700 mmÂ³, which I put down to rounding.
>
> Verdict: pass, ready to print.

